OL,3,GNEWSA'My treatment was a miracle,' says
OL,4,Astroke patient as new 24-hour service
OL,5,Arolled out
OL,6,
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland's regional
OL,8,Fthrombectomy service, which had only
OL,9,Fbeen available between 08:00 and 17:00
OL,10,Fis now operating 24 hours a day, seven
OL,11,Fdays a week after a #5m investment
OL,12,Fthrough Stormont's Programme for
OL,13,FGovernment (PfG) Elective Care funding.
